# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# The published contract set is byte-exact: the fixture wins over prose, consumers pin the SHA-256 of
# every file (LazyCrudExtension tests/fixtures/platform-contract/pin.json), and the same bytes ship
# inside Lazy.Crud.Builder.Templates. Line-ending conversion has no business here. It also left the
# tree dirty after every build: Directory.Build.targets regenerates the JSON fixtures with LF while
# text=auto checks them out as CRLF, so `git status` reported six modified fixtures for a build that
# changed nothing. Marker fixtures are CRLF because the marker header itself is; that is content.
contracts/** -text
